eam/apps/3822710/extras/bb81b541c1077851ba3400855b1c45c2.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/bb81b541c1077851ba3400855b1c45c2.apng?t=1757999310\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/e817d9d4ac84d635ca2d34814362ec6e.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/e817d9d4ac84d635ca2d34814362ec6e.apng?t=1757999310\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/f574780babb2778fedc882f5e9dc49a1.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/f574780babb2778fedc882f5e9dc49a1.webm?t=1757999310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/f574780babb2778fedc882f5e9dc49a1.mp4?t=1757999310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LinkShift is a deep strategy puzzle game about learning new ways of optimizing your Node placements, figuring out new scoring opportunities,\u00a0finding new strategies and evolving your game over time.\u00a0 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/2a840f4649a7ae5fd8a8bd7ae0db6a00.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/2a840f4649a7ae5fd8a8bd7ae0db6a00.apng?t=1757999310\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/567b0558800fa28ef41e6ee08c414dff.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/567b0558800fa28ef41e6ee08c414dff.apng?t=1757999310\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/526b20a4307918b0d3478cff81230ded.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/526b20a4307918b0d3478cff81230ded.apng?t=1757999310\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/bb81b541c1077851ba3400855b1c45c2.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/bb81b541c1077851ba3400855b1c45c2.apng?t=1757999310\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/e817d9d4ac84d635ca2d34814362ec6e.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/e817d9d4ac84d635ca2d34814362ec6e.apng?t=1757999310\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/ba4433a641853cd9e4e68eb9bbd7fc72.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/ba4433a641853cd9e4e68eb9bbd7fc72.webm?t=1757999310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/ba4433a641853cd9e4e68eb9bbd7fc72.mp4?t=1757999310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core gameplay lets you manage and place Nodes onto a grid.\u00a0Align and connect the Nodes to grow their Cores until they are big enough to collect and score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/2a840f4649a7ae5fd8a8bd7ae0db6a00.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/2a840f4649a7ae5fd8a8bd7ae0db6a00.apng?t=1757999310\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/567b0558800fa28ef41e6ee08c414dff.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/567b0558800fa28ef41e6ee08c414dff.apng?t=1757999310\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/526b20a4307918b0d3478cff81230ded.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/526b20a4307918b0d3478cff81230ded.apng?t=1757999310\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/bb81b541c1077851ba3400855b1c45c2.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/bb81b541c1077851ba3400855b1c45c2.apng?t=1757999310\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/e817d9d4ac84d635ca2d34814362ec6e.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/e817d9d4ac84d635ca2d34814362ec6e.apng?t=1757999310\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/d5ef0f54c8e09c28991fdfb1d0c49577.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/d5ef0f54c8e09c28991fdfb1d0c49577.webm?t=1757999310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/d5ef0f54c8e09c28991fdfb1d0c49577.mp4?t=1757999310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Master Nodes and your wits and creativity to bend the rules to create massive scoring combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock many unique Master Nodes that grant new ways of manipulating the grid.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/2a840f4649a7ae5fd8a8bd7ae0db6a00.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/2a840f4649a7ae5fd8a8bd7ae0db6a00.apng?t=1757999310\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/567b0558800fa28ef41e6ee08c414dff.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/567b0558800fa28ef41e6ee08c414dff.apng?t=1757999310\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span> \u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/526b20a4307918b0d3478cff81230ded.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/526b20a4307918b0d3478cff81230ded.apng?t=1757999310\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span>\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/bb81b541c1077851ba3400855b1c45c2.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/bb81b541c1077851ba3400855b1c45c2.apng?t=1757999310\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/e817d9d4ac84d635ca2d34814362ec6e.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/e817d9d4ac84d635ca2d34814362ec6e.apng?t=1757999310\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/956ef5d8149bb507fa55cba9573659df.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/956ef5d8149bb507fa55cba9573659df.webm?t=1757999310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/956ef5d8149bb507fa55cba9573659df.mp4?t=1757999310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Exploration Mode, collect upgrades called Boosters to increase your survivability or scoring power. Find unique combinations and synergies to tech your way onto the global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/985a3bd4782288a52b226cf0f0cd4993.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/985a3bd4782288a52b226cf0f0cd4993.webm?t=1757999310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/985a3bd4782288a52b226cf0f0cd4993.mp4?t=1757999310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or play the Relaxation Mode to just relax and go with the flow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1.0 FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Game Modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new unique Master Nodes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new Boosters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full SteamDeck support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touch enabled.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3822710?t=1757999310","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/99562a3a80256e3448959069632bf3723f5a85d9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757999310","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/6d103fe9f9c3a13309036c9e75e3967c9b8a447c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757999310","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/6d103fe9f9c3a13309036c9e75e3967c9b8a447c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757999310","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/b239366200e21a635aed717acc9dcd1b.avif?t=175799