32 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/567b0558800fa28ef41e6ee08c414dff.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/567b0558800fa28ef41e6ee08c414dff.apng?t=1757999310\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/526b20a4307918b0d3478cff81230ded.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/526b20a4307918b0d3478cff81230ded.apng?t=1757999310\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/bb81b541c1077851ba3400855b1c45c2.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/bb81b541c1077851ba3400855b1c45c2.apng?t=1757999310\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/e817d9d4ac84d635ca2d34814362ec6e.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/e817d9d4ac84d635ca2d34814362ec6e.apng?t=1757999310\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/ba4433a641853cd9e4e68eb9bbd7fc72.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/ba4433a641853cd9e4e68eb9bbd7fc72.webm?t=1757999310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/ba4433a641853cd9e4e68eb9bbd7fc72.mp4?t=1757999310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core gameplay lets you manage and place Nodes onto a grid.\u00a0Align and connect the Nodes to grow their Cores until they are big enough to collect and score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/2a840f4649a7ae5fd8a8bd7ae0db6a00.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/2a840f4649a7ae5fd8a8bd7ae0db6a00.apng?t=1757999310\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/567b0558800fa28ef41e6ee08c414dff.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/567b0558800fa28ef41e6ee08c414dff.apng?t=1757999310\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/extras/526b20a4307918b0d3478cff81230ded.poster.avif?t=1757999310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822710/e